  ("Every hour I take a break from the screen and look out the window.", "Har soatda ekrandan tanaffus qilib, derazadan tashqariga qarayman."),
  ("I love the lovely smell in the house when my mother bakes bread.", "Onam non yopganda uydagi yoqimli hidni juda yaxshi ko'raman."),
